    },
    {
      "en": "It is raining outside.",
      "ka": "გარეთ წვიმს."
    },
    {
      "en": "We are not watching TV.",
      "ka": "ჩვენ ტელევიზორს არ ვუყურებთ."
    }
  ],
  "common_mistakes_ka": "• ❌ She reading now. → ✅ She is reading now. (is აუცილებელია!)\n• ❌ I read now. → ✅ I am reading now. (ახლა = Present Continuous!)\n• ❌ He is runing. → ✅ He is running. (ორმაგი n!)\n• ❌ She is makeing. → ✅ She is making. (e იშლება!)",
